SUMMARY:Mark Curry
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:Class is back in session\, and Mr. Cooper has absolutely no int
 
ention of behaving! Comedy legend Mark Curry is bringing his razor-sharp wi
 
t\, outrageous storytelling\, and larger-than-life personality to The Stand
 
 Up Comedy Club! Best known for his hit sitcom Hangin' with Mr. Cooper\, Cu
 
rry has spent decades making audiences lose their minds laughing. He's host
 
ed Showtime at the Apollo\, rocked HBO comedy specials\, and even opened fo
 
r legends like Richard Pryor and Whitney Houston. Not bad for a guy whose T
 
V character was supposed to be teaching kids! Expect unpredictable punchlin
 
es\, hilarious crowd interactions\, and absolutely zero homework. Grab your
 
 tickets NOW before the only thing hanging is the SOLD OUT sign! **********
 
************************** SCAM ALERT -- IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMATION *****
 
******************************* To protect our customers\, please DO NOT pu
 
rchase tickets from third-party sites such as StubHub\, VividSeats\, BoxOff
 
iceTicketSales\, EventTicketCenter\, eTickets\, Ticket-Center\, TicketSales
 
\, or any other unauthorized platforms. These sellers are not affiliated wi
 
th us and often charge inflated prices. All tickets purchased through our o
 
fficial site are WILL CALL ONLY --- they will not be emailed to you. You wi
 
ll receive a confirmation email after your purchase\, and your tickets will
 
 be available for pick-up at the door on the night of the show. We will nev
 
er ask you to call a 1-800 number. If you have any questions\, please call 
 
us directly at 562-202-9944. Our ONLY authorized ticketing partner is Ticke
 
tWeb\, which is linked directly from our website: TheStandUpClub.com. Ticke
 
t resale is strictly prohibited. Tickets suspected of being purchased for t
 
he sole purpose of resale may be canceled at the discretion of The Stand Up
 
 Club. To ensure your tickets are valid\, always purchase directly from The
 
StandUpClub.com or TicketWeb.com. Stay safe. Don't get scammed. Tickets & i
 
nfo: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/mark-curry-the-stand-up-comedy-club-ti
 
ckets/15050923
